(3796,	'App\\User',	3,	'created',	'App\\Release',	1884,	'[]',	'{\"tracklist_show_artist\":\"1\",\"tracklist_show_title\":\"1\",\"tracklist_show_mix\":\"1\",\"visible\":true,\"title\":\"Daria Letto - Moments (The Album)\",\"genre\":\"Orchestral \\/ Cinematic \\/ Symphonic\",\"release_number\":\"CPR003243\",\"exclusive_period\":\"No Exclusive Period\",\"beatport\":null,\"youtube\":null,\"tracklist_show_custom\":\"0\",\"tracklist\":null,\"description_en\":\"<p>It was not a long time since we released two cinematic orchestral EPs by Dariya Letto and Ukrainian composer is ready to show her brand new album! Seven emotional atmospheric compositions tells seven musical stories, seven moments of life in their consistency tells complete all-in-one musical story just like exciting movie.<br>&nbsp;<\\/p>\",\"description_ru\":\"<p>It was not a long time since we released two cinematic orchestral EPs by Dariya Letto and Ukrainian composer is ready to show her brand new album! Seven emotional atmospheric compositions tells seven musical stories, seven moments of life in their consistency tells complete all-in-one musical story just like exciting movie.<br>&nbsp;<\\/p>\",\"description_ua\":\"<p>It was not a long time since we released two cinematic orchestral EPs by Dariya Letto and Ukrainian composer is ready to show her brand new album! Seven emotional atmospheric compositions tells seven musical stories, seven moments of life in their consistency tells complete all-in-one musical story just like exciting movie.<br>&nbsp;<\\/p>\",\"uploaded_on_beatport\":\"0\",\"uploaded_on_believe\":\"0\",\"uploaded_on_juno\":\"0\",\"uploaded_on_google_drive\":\"0\",\"label_copy_uploaded\":\"0\",\"promo_upload\":\"0\",\"uploaded_on_zip_dj\":\"0\",\"uploaded_on_music_worx\":\"0\",\"uploaded_on_release_promo\":\"0\",\"is_emailing_done\":\"0\",\"release_date\":\"2024-04-26 00:00:00\",\"sort_id\":386,\"image\":\"-daria-letto-moments-the-album_500.jpg\",\"image_270\":\"-daria-letto-moments-the-album_