t! It is dedicated to support of Ukrainian musicians and all Ukrainian people by the international DJs from all over the world. <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.mixcloud.com\\/CTS_Podcasts\\/djs-support-ukraine-podcast-by-hanna-hais\\/\\\"><strong>First show<\\/strong><\\/a> made by <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/hannahaisparis?__cft__[0]=AZWOhjgkdW2LJYSrCkbhSOpJroMEc7HjxJ4S-iTuEmUyBQwRFJoMyTzQO4vW9uGgnyH7AhLraNSTt2tiYaic0_EzBRO4yO63Gac8Hc7IuGlibLnJHQN6VkjskU11vufujuT_DM2TF3wWLYlt-ImWgmq0O5SvEvk0PhOVp2_uv1HGfmUbxEtF-NzzldQoz38eU2Y&amp;__tn__=-]K-R\\\"><strong>Hanna Hais<\\/strong><\\/a> (Atal Music, France).<\\/p><p>Hanna Hais says: <i>\\\"I made this mix for all the Ukrainian people who are suffering from an unjust war, especially for the Ukrainian soldiers who are on the front lines, and in<\\/i> <i>particular, the wounded ones. You are in our hearts, and we will not forget you. You are protecting your country, your families, your friends, and also the rest of Europe. Thank you.\\\"<\\/i><\\/p><p>Disclaimer: This work was produced with the financial assistance of the European Union. The views expressed herein can in no way be taken to reflect the official opinion of the European Union.<\\/p>\",\"description_ru\":\"<p>\\u041c\\u044b \\u0440\\u0430\\u0434\\u044b \\u043d\\u0430\\u0447\\u0430\\u0442\\u044c \\u043d\\u043e\\u0432\\u0443\\u044e \\u0441\\u0435\\u0440\\u0438\\u044e \\u043f\\u043e\\u0434\\u043a\\u0430\\u0441\\u0442\\u043e\\u0432 DJs Support Ukraine Podcast! \\u041f\\u0440\\u043e\\u0435\\u043a\\u0442 \\u043f\\u043e\\u0441\\u0432\\u044f\\u0449\\u0435\\u043d \\u043f\\u043e\\u0434\\u0434\\u0435\\u0440\\u0436\\u043a\\u0435 \\u0443\\u043a\\u0440\\u0430\\u0438\\u043d\\u0441\\u043a\\u0438\\u0445 \\u043c\\u0443\\u0437\\u044b\\u043a\\u0430\\u043d\\u0442\\u043e\\u0432 \\u0438 \\u0432\\u0441\\u0435\\u0433\\u043e \\u0443\\u043a\\u0440\\u0430\\u0438\\u043d\\u0441\\u043a\\u043e\\u0433\\u043e \\u043d\\u0430\\u0440\\u043e\\u0434\\u0430 \\u043c\\u0435\\u0436\\u0434\\u