ews\":true,\"pivot\":{\"release_id\":\"1112\",\"track_id\":\"1641\"}},{\"id\":1642,\"name\":\"Little One\",\"mix_name\":\"Original Mix\",\"artists\":\"Tka4\",\"remixers\":[\"\"],\"composer\":\"Tka4\",\"isrc\":null,\"bpm\":null,\"genre\":null,\"length\":\"04:27\",\"beatport_id\":null,\"beatport_slug\":null,\"beatport_release_id\":null,\"beatport_wave\":null,\"beatport_sample\":\"https:\\/\\/cts-label.com\\/audio\\/CTS100\\/Tka4_-_Little_One.mp3\",\"beatport_sample_start\":\"\",\"beatport_sample_end\":\"\",\"created_at\":\"2023-01-10T11:11:20.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2023-01-30T08:07:29.000000Z\",\"youtube\":null,\"show_reviews\":true,\"pivot\":{\"release_id\":\"1112\",\"track_id\":\"1642\"}}]}',	'https://cts-label.com/cts-admin/releases/1112',	'194.28.197.123',	'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64; rv:144.0) Gecko/20100101 Firefox/144.0',	NULL,	'2025-10-19 10:01:13',	'2025-10-19 10:01:13'),
(9282,	'App\\User',	3,	'updated',	'App\\Release',	1112,	'{\"description_en\":null,\"exclusive_period\":null}',	'{\"description_en\":\"<p>For its sixth anniversary, Ukrainian independent label CTS RECORDS is releasing its 100th digital release! This anniversary release from one of the first Ukrainian imprints features works by legendary Ukrainian artists \\u2013 those who helped shape the emergence of Ukrainian club culture. \\\"From today\'s perspective, we see how the Ukrainian electronic scene has evolved. This release is our contribution to the history of Ukrainian electronic music, an unprecedented event when the masters of the Ukrainian electronic scene have presented their works together on a single EP,\\\" says CTS Records founder Sergio Mega. CTS RECORDS\'s 100th release opens with \\\"Qzzaargh \\u2013 I Want to Rock\\\" by legendary musician, DJ, and figure of Ukrainian electronic culture, Sergey Kuzminsky, aka DJ Kuzya, a member of the band \\\"Brothers Gadyukiny,\\\" known for his numerous projects in the music industry since the Soviet era. Also featured is \\\"Tka4 \\u2013 Little One\\\" by renowned Ukrainian composer Vasyl Tkach. A new track from DJ DerBastler, a producer and one of the founders of the Ukrainian electronic scene, Chord Snatchers\' South project. Anatoliy Vexklyarsky, aka DJ Tolya, one of the first Ukrainian DJs, a renowned TV and radio host, musician, and playwright, has contributed a composition to CTS RECORDS\'s 100th release: Vexlarsky Orchestra\'s MoralEAST... CTS Records has made the anniversary release, CTS100, specially for fans of Ukrainian electronic music available for <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/cts-label.com\\/audio\\/CTS100\\/CTS100.zip\\\"><strong>free download<\\/strong><\\/a>... ENJOY...<\\/p>\",\"exclusive_period\":\"No Exclusive Period\"}',	'https://cts-label.com/cts-admin/releases/1112',	'194.28.197.123',	'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64; rv:144.0) Gecko/20100101 Firefox/144.0',	NULL,	'2025-10-19 10:01:13',	'2025-10-19 10:01:13'),
