(9787,	'App\\User',	3,	'updated',	'App\\Release',	1479,	'{\"youtube\":\"\",\"description_en\":\"We are proud to announce CTS #200 release. <br \\/>\\r\\nSince 2004 CTS records has kept direction between House and Techno sound, this trend is reflected in the compilation. Selection of &laquo;must have&raquo; tunes which will always fit to any party, is presented in it. Tracks and remixes by DJ Pierre, Sergio Mega, Yan Oxygen, Louie Cut, Aquabeat, Kotov &amp; Andre Wilde, Truati, Gaga, DJ Lion, Nathan Barato, M.I.D.I., Juan DDD, Slackers Project and more, dancefloor burners, will satisfy djs and clubbers taste &amp; requirments... 201 release is not far off, keep dancing...<br \\/>\",\"tracklist\":\"Yan Oxygen - Endless Way (Original Mix)<br \\/>\\r\\nSergio Mega feat. Niels Von Geyer - She Loves The Rain (Yan Oxygen Remix)<br \\/>\\r\\nM.I.D.I. - Back Time (Slackers Project Remix)<br \\/>\\r\\nAquabeat - Inception (Gaga Remix)<br \\/>\\r\\nAquabeat feat. Rey-Na - Cocaine (Truati Remix)<br \\/>\\r\\nAquabeat - Whisky (Louie Cut Remix)<br \\/>\\r\\nYan Oxygen - System Off (Bockscar Remix)<br \\/>\\r\\nDeb feat. MC Yug - Plastic Toys (Nick Zero Prog Mix)<br \\/>\\r\\nYan Oxygen - Revolution<br \\/>\\r\\nYan Oxygen - System Off<br \\/>\\r\\nAquabeat feat. Rey-Na - Ride The Time (Sergio Mega Remix)<br \\/>\\r\\nAquabeat feat. Rey-Na - Cocaine (Vein Litterback Remix)<br \\/>\\r\\nAquabeat and Yan Oxygen - Earth 2160 (Juan DDD Fucking Remix)<br \\/>\\r\\nYan Oxygen - Unknown Science<br \\/>\\r\\nFresh and Majestic - Funky House<br \\/>\\r\\nMantrique - Optimistika<br \\/>\\r\\nShiz - Insomnia (Sergio Mega Remix)<br \\/>\\r\\nKotov &amp; Andre Wilde - Jump (Nathan Barato Anti Vox Remix)<br \\/>\\r\\nYan Oxygen - Stay (Original Mix)<br \\/>\\r\\nSlackers Project - Disco Rocker<br \\/>\\r\\nKotov &amp; Andre Wilde - Mini Human Beings (Original Mix)<br \\/>\\r\\nAquabeat and Yan Oxygen - Earth 2160 (Original Mix)<br \\/>\\r\\nSergio Mega - Stereoland (Club Mix)<br \\/>\\r\\nSergio Mega feat. Niels von Geyer - Dance Not Over (DJ Lion Remix)<br \\/>\\r\\nKotov and Andre Wilde - Ze Ozer Vang (Anthony Attalla Remix)<br \\/>\\r\\nSergio Mega feat. Niels von Geyer - Dance Not Over (Club Dub)<br \\/>\\r\\nSergio Mega feat. Storm Tarrion - Only Friends (DJ Pierre Afro Acid Remix)\"}',	'{\"youtube\":null,\"description_en\":\"<p>We are proud to announce CTS #200 release.&nbsp;<br>Since 2004 CTS records has kept direction between House and Techno sound, this trend is reflected in the compilation. Selection of \\u00abmust have\\u00bb tunes which will always fit to any party, is presented in it. Tracks and remixes by DJ Pierre, Sergio Mega, Yan Oxygen, Louie Cut, Aquabeat, Kotov &amp; Andre Wilde, Truati, Gaga, DJ Lion, Nathan Barato, M.I.D.I., Juan DDD, Slackers Project and more, dancefloor burners, will satisfy djs and clubbers taste &amp; requirments... 201 release is not far off, keep dancing...<br>&nbsp;<\\/p>\",\"tracklist\":\"<p>Yan Oxygen - Endless Way (Original Mix)<br>Sergio Mega feat. Niels Von Geyer - She Loves The Rain (Yan Oxygen Remix)<br>M.I.D.I. - Back Time (Slackers Project Remix)<br>Aquabeat - Inception (Gaga Remix)<br>Aquabeat feat. Rey-Na - Cocaine (Truati Remix)<br>Aquabeat - Whisky (Louie Cut Remix)<br>Yan Oxygen - System Off (Bockscar Remix)<br>Deb feat. MC Yug - Plastic Toys (Nick Zero Prog Mix)<br>Yan Oxygen - Revolution<br>Yan Oxygen - System Off<br>Aquabeat feat. Rey-Na - Ride The Time (Sergio Mega Remix)<br>Aquabeat feat. Rey-Na - Cocaine (Vein Litterback Remix)<br>Aquabeat and Yan Oxygen - Earth 2160 (Juan DDD Fucking Remix)<br>Yan Oxygen - Unknown Science<br>Fresh and Majestic - Funky House<br>Mantrique - Optimistika<br>Shiz - Insomnia (Sergio Mega Remix)<br>Kotov &amp; Andre Wilde - Jump (Nathan Barato Anti Vox Remix)<br>Yan Oxygen - Stay (Original Mix)<br>Slackers Project - Disco Rocker<br>Kotov &amp; Andre Wilde - Mini Human Beings (Original Mix)<br>Aquabeat and Yan Oxygen - Earth 2160 (Original Mix)<br>Sergio Mega - Stereoland (Club Mix)<br>Sergio Mega feat. Niels von Geyer - Dance Not Over (DJ Lion Remix)<br>Kotov and Andre Wilde - Ze Ozer Vang (Anthony Attalla Remix)<br>Sergio Mega feat. Niels von Geyer - Dance Not Over (Club Dub)<br>Sergio Mega feat. Storm Tarrion - Only Friends (DJ Pierre Afro Acid Remix)<\\/p>\"}',	'http://cts-label.local/cts-admin/releases/1479',	'192.168.65.1',	'Mozilla/5.0 (Macintosh; Intel Mac OS X 10.15; rv:149.0) Gecko/20100101 Firefox/149.0',	NULL,	'2026-04-21 19:06:23',	'2026-04-21 19:06:23'),
