(53,	40,	'Duart Jansen',	'info@duartjansen.com',	'{\"Bas Kunnen - Electro Groove Odyssey (Original Mix)\":\"9\",\"Sergio Mega - Spin It Back (Original Mix)\":\"8\",\"Sergio Mega, Bas Kunnen - Spin It Back X Electro Groove Odyssey (Special Sergio Mega Mashup)\":\"8\"}',	'Bas Kunnen - Electro Groove Odyssey (Original Mix)',	'Nice release, Sergio\'s track bangs but is a bit less melodic for my taste, so my favorite is the Bas Kunnen track. I do like the idea of the Mashup though, interesting approach to a remix alternative of both tracks at once.',	'2023-12-06 20:28:24',	'2024-05-09 14:23:06',	1),
